(2887992, 404645, 54747, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the age of the camera and the spider are disconcerting, as is the contrast between the somewhat organic feel of the camera (via patina, primarily) and the artificiality of the spider (via the sheen and feeling of "newness").</td>', 'The contrast between the age of the camera and the spider are disconcerting, as is the contrast between the somewhat organic feel of the camera (via patina, primarily) and the artificiality of the spider (via the sheen and feeling of "newness").', '2006-10-02 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
