(2888126, 403348, 54747, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot creates a broken line at the top that draws the eye because of the contrast between it and the wall.  I also don''t see the relationship between the tissue and the toy, other than they are in the same frame.</td>', 'The angle of the shot creates a broken line at the top that draws the eye because of the contrast between it and the wall.  I also don''t see the relationship between the tissue and the toy, other than they are in the same frame.', '2006-10-02 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
