(2888411, 404704, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m curious if you''ve gotten a comment like this - ''This is DNMC, the challenge is gather exactly two objects that are totally unrelated'' - I got a comment like that on my photo. Your photo has pears, lightbulbs AND a plate - I guess that''s 3 objects. However, I find your photo quite acceptable and very nice on top of that. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'I''m curious if you''ve gotten a comment like this - ''This is DNMC, the challenge is gather exactly two objects that are totally unrelated'' - I got a comment like that on my photo. Your photo has pears, lightbulbs AND a plate - I guess that''s 3 objects. However, I find your photo quite acceptable and very nice on top of that. Good luck to ya!', '2006-10-02 18:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888418, 404607, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!</td>', 'Hilarious!', '2006-10-02 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
