(2894507, 403873, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph - the sense of dynamic is very strong, giving a real interaction and motion to the shot. Can''t help but think that ''toilet papers'' might have been a better title, but maybe that only works for the English. This should win - I don''t believe it will, but it should.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph - the sense of dynamic is very strong, giving a real interaction and motion to the shot. Can''t help but think that ''toilet papers'' might have been a better title, but maybe that only works for the English. This should win - I don''t believe it will, but it should.', '2006-10-04 05:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
