(2897398, 404698, 66569, '<td valign="top">creative!</td>', 'creative!', '2006-10-04 21:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897524, 404613, 41337, '<td valign="top">Yeah that would be nice. Great concept you got here although money growing on trees would have a quicker impact with the voters, IMO and since voters probably spend no more than a few seconds on each photo a quicker impact helps.</td>', 'Yeah that would be nice. Great concept you got here although money growing on trees would have a quicker impact with the voters, IMO and since voters probably spend no more than a few seconds on each photo a quicker impact helps.', '2006-10-04 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897537, 404532, 41337, '<td valign="top">Hehehe. I wish I had your problem. My problem is never even getting a signal to begin with. :P Btw, nice use of two unrelated items although it now appears to be about a hundred items. :P</td>', 'Hehehe. I wish I had your problem. My problem is never even getting a signal to begin with. :P Btw, nice use of two unrelated items although it now appears to be about a hundred items. :P', '2006-10-04 21:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897551, 404608, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good image. The lighting on the flower is a little flat for my tastes. I like the angle of the light so maybe just think about burning the petals a bit to give it more depth and shape?</td>', 'Good image. The lighting on the flower is a little flat for my tastes. I like the angle of the light so maybe just think about burning the petals a bit to give it more depth and shape?', '2006-10-04 21:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897575, 403282, 57775, '<td valign="top">I really like this - one of the more elegant photos in the challenge.  The only nitpick I have is the fact that the glass is cut off on the bottom.  9.</td>', 'I really like this - one of the more elegant photos in the challenge.  The only nitpick I have is the fact that the glass is cut off on the bottom.  9.', '2006-10-04 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897579, 404614, 41337, '<td valign="top">Most definitely not. Kinda looks like dreadlocks to me. :P This photo screams unrelatedness so congrats there. The technicals are ok but lacks anything special or unique.</td>', 'Most definitely not. Kinda looks like dreadlocks to me. :P This photo screams unrelatedness so congrats there. The technicals are ok but lacks anything special or unique.', '2006-10-04 21:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897584, 404607, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great take to the challenge and well shot too. Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Great take to the challenge and well shot too. Hope this does well for you.', '2006-10-04 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897589, 403786, 57775, '<td valign="top">Is this a drum?  Very cute photo, but wish it wasn''t cropped as tightly as it is.</td>', 'Is this a drum?  Very cute photo, but wish it wasn''t cropped as tightly as it is.', '2006-10-04 21:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897601, 404669, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but the composition feels slightly crooked, like the picture should have been rotated a few degrees counter clockwise.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but the composition feels slightly crooked, like the picture should have been rotated a few degrees counter clockwise.', '2006-10-04 21:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897606, 404504, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The technicals are also good. I might have cloned out those specs on the egg itself just to make it cleaner. Also, this might have worked better as a b/w since the image is pretty much that already.</td>', 'I like the concept. The technicals are also good. I might have cloned out those specs on the egg itself just to make it cleaner. Also, this might have worked better as a b/w since the image is pretty much that already.', '2006-10-04 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897608, 403756, 57775, '<td valign="top">The flowers in the foreground are great, but the background looks very dark and fuzzy to me - not quite sure what''s back there - a tire?</td>', 'The flowers in the foreground are great, but the background looks very dark and fuzzy to me - not quite sure what''s back there - a tire?', '2006-10-04 21:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897612, 404707, 57775, '<td valign="top">Haha... great idea.  Might''ve worked a little better visually with a pure white background, but still good overall.</td>', 'Haha... great idea.  Might''ve worked a little better visually with a pure white background, but still good overall.', '2006-10-04 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897616, 404692, 57775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-10-04 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897620, 404627, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is great.</td>', 'This is great.', '2006-10-04 21:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897633, 404702, 41337, '<td valign="top">Like the concept and this meets the challenge perfectly. Some noise reduction would have help especially since there are no fine details to worry about damaging.</td>', 'Like the concept and this meets the challenge perfectly. Some noise reduction would have help especially since there are no fine details to worry about damaging.', '2006-10-04 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897637, 404598, 57775, '<td valign="top">Haha - just wrong.  I love it.</td>', 'Haha - just wrong.  I love it.', '2006-10-04 21:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897639, 404629, 57775, '<td valign="top">Haha - cute little guy.  I like this a lot, but might''ve liked it more with a whiter background.</td>', 'Haha - cute little guy.  I like this a lot, but might''ve liked it more with a whiter background.', '2006-10-04 21:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897651, 404467, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well shot. To me it doesn''t seem like you made any sense out of the two objects but maybe I''m just missing that?</td>', 'Well shot. To me it doesn''t seem like you made any sense out of the two objects but maybe I''m just missing that?', '2006-10-04 21:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897655, 403500, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot, but the yellow seems oversaturated, and the reflections on the front of the picture are distracting.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot, but the yellow seems oversaturated, and the reflections on the front of the picture are distracting.', '2006-10-04 21:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897661, 403821, 57775, '<td valign="top">I like this - very simple and effective.</td>', 'I like this - very simple and effective.', '2006-10-04 21:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897671, 404660, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like that there is a concept here and you didn''t just shoot two things. Although I wouldn''t have worded your title the way you did (i.e remove the last part) since on quick glance the two objects appear to be the spoon and the cereal bowl.</td>', 'Nice image. I like that there is a concept here and you didn''t just shoot two things. Although I wouldn''t have worded your title the way you did (i.e remove the last part) since on quick glance the two objects appear to be the spoon and the cereal bowl.', '2006-10-04 21:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897675, 404207, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great photo - I''ll still vote it high even though you''re over the two object limit.</td>', 'Great photo - I''ll still vote it high even though you''re over the two object limit.', '2006-10-04 21:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897676, 403786, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the baby is relating to this. :P</td>', 'I''m not sure the baby is relating to this. :P', '2006-10-04 21:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897688, 404621, 41337, '<td valign="top">Yeah delicious indeed! I think you made this too complicated then it needed to be. Just the box, which I can easily tell is a pizza box and the record would have worked, IMO.</td>', 'Yeah delicious indeed! I think you made this too complicated then it needed to be. Just the box, which I can easily tell is a pizza box and the record would have worked, IMO.', '2006-10-04 21:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897697, 403742, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great photo - a ribbon contender?   I might''ve liked to see some bits of egg shell scattered on the floor, as if the flower had just hatched, but this is great.</td>', 'Great photo - a ribbon contender?   I might''ve liked to see some bits of egg shell scattered on the floor, as if the flower had just hatched, but this is great.', '2006-10-04 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897699, 404234, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The house in the lower corner is really not helping your shot.</td>', 'Good concept. The house in the lower corner is really not helping your shot.', '2006-10-04 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897702, 403806, 57775, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - this should do well.</td>', 'Wonderful - this should do well.', '2006-10-04 21:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897705, 404531, 41337, '<td valign="top">He''s probably blinded by that light! I think this would have worked much better if the sun didn''t shine through like that. Everything else about this I like.</td>', 'He''s probably blinded by that light! I think this would have worked much better if the sun didn''t shine through like that. Everything else about this I like.', '2006-10-04 21:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897709, 403388, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept.  I just wish the background was pure black... being able to see the texture of the floor detracts from the artistic value.</td>', 'This is a great concept.  I just wish the background was pure black... being able to see the texture of the floor detracts from the artistic value.', '2006-10-04 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897711, 403806, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great concept. About the only thing you could do to improve this is to have that plugged into a wall socket but maybe leave that for Take Two II!</td>', 'Nice! Great concept. About the only thing you could do to improve this is to have that plugged into a wall socket but maybe leave that for Take Two II!', '2006-10-04 22:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897715, 404651, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very clean. The glass blinds it a bit too much into the background but otherwise this is a good shot.</td>', 'Very clean. The glass blinds it a bit too much into the background but otherwise this is a good shot.', '2006-10-04 22:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897717, 403408, 41337, '<td valign="top">That''s one funky ducky. I bet we''ll see this guy once again real soon. Nice shot. Works well for the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'That''s one funky ducky. I bet we''ll see this guy once again real soon. Nice shot. Works well for the challenge. Good luck!', '2006-10-04 22:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897721, 404651, 57775, '<td valign="top">Very clever, and well shot too.</td>', 'Very clever, and well shot too.', '2006-10-04 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
