(2898779, 404580, 49109, '<td valign="top">1,2,3, DNMC. Don''t vote it lower because you gathered the objects on a hand, but because the two objects ARE related, arent they? I''m not into religions, but the stone looks like a religious symbol to me - correct me if I''m wrong...<br/>It''s still a high quality shot, good composition and color.</td>', '1,2,3, DNMC. Don''t vote it lower because you gathered the objects on a hand, but because the two objects ARE related, arent they? I''m not into religions, but the stone looks like a religious symbol to me - correct me if I''m wrong...It''s still a high quality shot, good composition and color.', '2006-10-05 04:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2898815, 404660, 49109, '<td valign="top">quite a dilemma, i count at least 3 objects (pebbles, plate with milk, spoon), but i like the idea and will not vote it lower therefor.<br/> the reflection in the spoon and on the plate are rather distracting, you should have used softer light and tilted the spoon to the left side.</td>', 'quite a dilemma, i count at least 3 objects (pebbles, plate with milk, spoon), but i like the idea and will not vote it lower therefor. the reflection in the spoon and on the plate are rather distracting, you should have used softer light and tilted the spoon to the left side.', '2006-10-05 04:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899328, 404634, 64175, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun day of Mudding, but as a viewer, I don''t see how this fit the challenge criteria of "unrelatedness".</td>', 'Looks like a fun day of Mudding, but as a viewer, I don''t see how this fit the challenge criteria of "unrelatedness".', '2006-10-05 10:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899330, 404646, 64175, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but I don''t see how this met the challenge criteria.</td>', 'Cute shot, but I don''t see how this met the challenge criteria.', '2006-10-05 10:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899333, 404387, 64175, '<td valign="top">The image is so dark, that it loses a lot of its character for the entire right third of the photo.</td>', 'The image is so dark, that it loses a lot of its character for the entire right third of the photo.', '2006-10-05 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899342, 404538, 64175, '<td valign="top">The focal point seems to be the sun reflection on the water. There is not enough contrast in the blue containter to draw your eye to it so you search for the subject.  Better lighting on the container itself would have improved this shot.</td>', 'The focal point seems to be the sun reflection on the water. There is not enough contrast in the blue containter to draw your eye to it so you search for the subject.  Better lighting on the container itself would have improved this shot.', '2006-10-05 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899348, 403821, 64175, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Nice color and lighting, but it fails to send me the message of the challenge criteria (unrelatedness).</td>', 'This is a great shot. Nice color and lighting, but it fails to send me the message of the challenge criteria (unrelatedness).', '2006-10-05 10:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
