(2899584, 404706, 66353, '<td valign="top">To me this does not meet the challenge "Unrelatedness". To me this challenge suggests that you should show a picture of two elements that are not commonly seen together, and I don''t feel that to be the case here.</td>', 'To me this does not meet the challenge "Unrelatedness". To me this challenge suggests that you should show a picture of two elements that are not commonly seen together, and I don''t feel that to be the case here.', '2006-10-05 11:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2899588, 403500, 50034, '<td valign="top">Very healthy!   Fluid break in the middle of a game of Squash!!!!   ;)<br/>   Technically though...Blues are great!  However, I''ll bet you were a bit concerned over the yellow "near-wash-out" splat at the base of the "neck" of the squash and on the upper neck(at least according to my monitor (laptop LCD.)  I wonder if burn-in tool would help.  It seems to me that a smallish size &amp; a steady hand would be required.  Hope that helps.   :)</td>', 'Very healthy!   Fluid break in the middle of a game of Squash!!!!   ;)   Technically though...Blues are great!  However, I''ll bet you were a bit concerned over the yellow "near-wash-out" splat at the base of the "neck" of the squash and on the upper neck(at least according to my monitor (laptop LCD.)  I wonder if burn-in tool would help.  It seems to me that a smallish size & a steady hand would be required.  Hope that helps.   :)', '2006-10-05 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
