(2902402, 402494, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now this just cracks me up!  How did you get pigs on the beach??  You''ll have undoubtedly heard your horizon isn''t level, but with pigs on a beach, who needs a level horizon?</td>', 'Now this just cracks me up!  How did you get pigs on the beach??  You''ll have undoubtedly heard your horizon isn''t level, but with pigs on a beach, who needs a level horizon?', '2006-10-06 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
