(2908399, 404181, 29904, '<td valign="top">Really like this idea, setup/composition, and lighting, and dont know how you got the match to stand straight!<br/>Would improve it if the spoon were shiney/reflective, and maybe if a faster shutter to get a crisp flame?<br/>World Market (if you have one there) has beautiful utensils you can buy individually, for future projects.<br/>Hope that helps :)  Nice job!</td>', 'Really like this idea, setup/composition, and lighting, and dont know how you got the match to stand straight!Would improve it if the spoon were shiney/reflective, and maybe if a faster shutter to get a crisp flame?World Market (if you have one there) has beautiful utensils you can buy individually, for future projects.Hope that helps :)  Nice job!', '2006-10-08 15:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
