(2909547, 403777, 29269, '<td valign="top">I liked this one! As Daniel mentioned, very artsy. I hope this does not differ too much from the original - while noone will probably ask for a DQ now, be careful with the motion blur effect. If you add something that hasn''t been in the original photo, it is construed as adding a major element. If there was some motion blur to begin with, enhancing it is OK.<br/> <br/>I''m just saying this as I can forsee seeing one of your photos on the front page soon, so just wanted to make you aware of the details...<br/> <br/>Best of luck in future challenges!<br/></td>', 'I liked this one! As Daniel mentioned, very artsy. I hope this does not differ too much from the original - while noone will probably ask for a DQ now, be careful with the motion blur effect. If you add something that hasn''t been in the original photo, it is construed as adding a major element. If there was some motion blur to begin with, enhancing it is OK. I''m just saying this as I can forsee seeing one of your photos on the front page soon, so just wanted to make you aware of the details... Best of luck in future challenges!', '2006-10-09 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
