(2910745, 403408, 24454, '<td valign="top">This one too, Shez, is quite quite underrated.   I''m thinking that unless its a toy challenge, it seems photos of toys don''t score too well in the challenges.  But this is executed perfectly:  crisp, bright and vivid. Composed well.  Cute concept.  You did great.</td>', 'This one too, Shez, is quite quite underrated.   I''m thinking that unless its a toy challenge, it seems photos of toys don''t score too well in the challenges.  But this is executed perfectly:  crisp, bright and vivid. Composed well.  Cute concept.  You did great.', '2006-10-09 10:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2910807, 403325, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, shoot.  Why''d this cute photo score so low.  It''s crisp and sharp.  Vibrant striking colors.  Composed well technically.  Hmmmm.   No figuring what appeals to these voters is there!<br/></td>', 'Well, shoot.  Why''d this cute photo score so low.  It''s crisp and sharp.  Vibrant striking colors.  Composed well technically.  Hmmmm.   No figuring what appeals to these voters is there!', '2006-10-09 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
