(2910983, 403463, 57882, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by taterbug:</b></div><hr/><i> OMG, this shot just totally cracks me up! I mean, I am literally laughing out loud here. Not just the title, and the actual concept, but it''s execution is perfect parody of the whole dramatic idea,  that you see in movies, tv, ads, etc. The moody lighting, off centered comp to the left, the lost, forlorn, remorseful gaze off the frame of the subject. Just awesome. Awesome, awesome, awesome. It takes a lot for a shot with a figure, toy, etc. to move me at all, but man, you''ve totally nailed this one. Nice freakin'' job :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gene, Thanks for the feedback.  You''ve nailed exactly what I was going for.</td>', 'Originally posted by taterbug: OMG, this shot just totally cracks me up! I mean, I am literally laughing out loud here. Not just the title, and the actual concept, but it''s execution is perfect parody of the whole dramatic idea,  that you see in movies, tv, ads, etc. The moody lighting, off centered comp to the left, the lost, forlorn, remorseful gaze off the frame of the subject. Just awesome. Awesome, awesome, awesome. It takes a lot for a shot with a figure, toy, etc. to move me at all, but man, you''ve totally nailed this one. Nice freakin'' job :-)   Gene, Thanks for the feedback.  You''ve nailed exactly what I was going for.', '2006-10-09 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2910986, 403134, 12750, '<td valign="top">Haha, definately a DNMC.  I guess I learned my lesson. ;)  I still like the photo.<br/> <br/>FYI, there sure is some sticklers for topics that couldn''t be more objective..."gather"??  But thats the results of topic-based challenges! =) Thx for looking.</td>', 'Haha, definately a DNMC.  I guess I learned my lesson. ;)  I still like the photo. FYI, there sure is some sticklers for topics that couldn''t be more objective..."gather"??  But thats the results of topic-based challenges! =) Thx for looking.', '2006-10-09 11:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
