(2911960, 404367, 33560, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I thought this was one of the most memorable shots of the competition.  I also thought that it was as well executed most that outscored it.. I think the lightting is fantastic, and I like the use of color.  The expression is priceless, even though you cannot see this child''s eyes.  I might have cropped closer, but I tend to crop too closely.  Anyway, very nice shot.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I thought this was one of the most memorable shots of the competition.  I also thought that it was as well executed most that outscored it.. I think the lightting is fantastic, and I like the use of color.  The expression is priceless, even though you cannot see this child''s eyes.  I might have cropped closer, but I tend to crop too closely.  Anyway, very nice shot.', '2006-10-09 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
